Your Majesty,

I accept the judgement freely and gladly. I would far rather be Your Majesty'=
s beloved sister than an unhappy wife. England suits me, and I find I am very=
 fond of it.

Let us be friends. I hear the hunting at Richmond is excellent.

Your affectionate sister,
Anne of Cleves
